# Boost on 25's end save (run.py hgss_boost: np_save4 add-mon behind the party, as a gift; the story stays played).
# Party along the chain: 01-05 1 (CYNDAQUIL), 06 2 (+ the aide's Togepi egg), 10 3 (+ SCYTHER: Cut), 18 4
# (+ PELIPPER: Surf/Fly), with 14's FLAAFFY -> here 0 CYNDAQUIL, 1 Togepi, 2 SCYTHER, 3 FLAAFFY, 4 PELIPPER: size 5.
# Adds slot 5, the last free one: the carrier of the field moves the rest of the story needs and no member knows:
# - Strength (HM04, received in 20: scr_seq_0252_R42.s:16-96): the Ice Path B1F boulder (here), Victory Road 1F/2F
#   boulders (33); Rock Smash is not needed on either route (33's refs: Victory Road's breakrocks are off the way);
# - Whirlpool (HM05, received in 21: scr_seq_0090_D35R0103.s:694): SoulSilver 31, the Whirl Islands;
# - Waterfall (HM07, received here: the Ice Path 1F item ball): Tohjo Falls (32);
# - Dig (TM28, src/item.c:59): SoulSilver 32 digs out of Lugia's cave before flying.
# FERALIGATR learns all four: files/poketool/personal/personal.json:12586 (FERALIGATR) tms include 28 (TM28 Dig) and
# hms [1, 3, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8] (src/item.c:127-130: HM04 Strength, HM05 Whirlpool, HM07 Waterfall). The party menu
# lists them as field moves (src/party_menu.c:206-213). Lv40 is the stretch's (TRAINER_LEADER_CLAIR_CLAIR (35):
# GYARADOS 38, DRAGONAIR 38 x2, KINGDRA 41; TRAINER_RIVAL_SILVER_13 in 33: FERALIGATR 40 at the top); behind a fainted
# lead it fights with Waterfall/Strength (80 power) and Dig (Ground).
# Party after: 6, full (CYNDAQUIL, Togepi, SCYTHER, FLAAFFY, PELIPPER, FERALIGATR).
party SPECIES_FERALIGATR 40
party-move 5 0 MOVE_STRENGTH
party-move 5 1 MOVE_WHIRLPOOL
party-move 5 2 MOVE_WATERFALL
party-move 5 3 MOVE_DIG
